{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>וכפר [and wiped out].</b> Like ואיש חכם יכפרנה (Proverbs 16:14), in the sense of destruction and removal:" "<b>[וחזותכם את שאול [and your vision is Sheol]].</b> וברית חזותכם עם שאול:" "The vav of <b>והייתם [and you shall be]</b> is like peh rafah in the language of Ishmael, and similarly: ביום השלישי וישא אברהם את עיניו (Genesis 22:4):"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:39.089504092Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}